  (text "J100 is fabricated gold fingers, not an assembled connector.\nF-side/stiffener view, tip up: pin 1 LEFT. Gold-face view: pin 1 RIGHT.\nSix groups: Z4, Z5, Z6, Z1, Z2, Z3; each +,+,W,N,C.\nEach positive contact alone is rated for the 0.60 A zone screen.\nNo common positive supply across zones.\nStrip pin 1=+24V, 2=W, 3=N, 4=C.\nUnconnected strip ends receive power through lower flex and strip rails.\nThrough-rail continuity remains a physical test requirement."
    (at 28.0 250.0 0)
    (effects
      (font
        (size 1.0 1.0))
      (justify left top))
    (uuid "77bd97ee-f736-5c50-a914-d801d15e22e1")))
